<br>
Dis place not like udder dungeons.  You no wanna find a room to camp in an hole up der while Skiks goes-a-pullin.  Da best tactic, methinks at least, is to move da whole group from one spawn spot to anudder.  Just keep rollin along, doin the ol' sweep & clear.  You tend to get deeper into da dungeon, and get to see more of dis great place!<br>
<br>
